@startuml
title ST source selection for Simulator and tests
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
component "Delivered ST project" as project
component "Simulator source selection\ntrust_runtime::runtime_sources" as simulator
component "Debug adapter\nlaunch / reload" as adapter
component "Language server\ntrust-lsp.runEntry check" as entry
component "Test discovery\ntrust_runtime::test_discovery" as discovery
component "trust-dev test" as devtest
component "VS Code Testing view\ntrust-lsp.testDiscovery" as testing
component "Native runtime compilation" as compiler
component "Selected test cases" as selected
component "Cold restart and invoke\nper-case execution deadline" as execution
project --> simulator : ordinary sources\nignore test-only header
simulator --> adapter : the program's sources
simulator --> entry : the same sources
adapter --> compiler : PLC bindings
project --> discovery : retain test declarations
discovery --> devtest : namespace-qualified tests
discovery --> testing : the same tests and lines
devtest --> compiler : register all test programs\nincluding filtered-out siblings
devtest --> selected : optional name filter
compiler --> execution : complete compiled runtime
selected --> execution : invoke only matching cases
note bottom of execution
Human and structured JSON results report only executed cases.
Test headers preserve source assertions and test discovery.
end note
@enduml
